# Tests
# Patterns must be path-anchored: a bare `__tests__` only matches a root-level
# entry, so src/__tests__ (254 files) was still being copied into the build
# context. Next 16 type-checks those files during `next build`, and they import
# from scripts/ which IS ignored, so the image build failed with TS2307.
tests/
**/__tests__
e2e/
playwright.config.ts

